      <h2>About Afrihouse</h2>
      <p>Afrihouse is a Tanzanian hospitality and digital services business. It was started by Peter, a hospitality professional who has worked in short-term rental management since 2018.</p>
      <p>Peter has managed his own and other owners' properties on Airbnb and Booking.com. His work covers creating and improving listings, pricing and revenue optimisation, guest communication, check-in and check-out coordination, property inspections, owner reporting, photography and content, and customer service.</p>
      <p>That day-to-day experience shapes everything Afrihouse builds: websites and online listings made by someone who knows what guests ask, and what owners need to see.</p>
      <p class="role">Peter, Short-Term Rental &amp; Property Management Specialist</p>
    </div>
