      <article class="card"><h3>OTA listing setup &amp; optimisation</h3><p>Help creating, improving and managing listings on Airbnb, Booking.com and other online travel agencies, where supported.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Short-term rental &amp; property management</h3><p>Support with listing optimisation, pricing, guest communication, check-in and check-out coordination, and the guest experience.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Hospitality digital marketing</h3><p>Website content, online visibility, social media content and digital marketing support.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Hospitality business consulting</h3><p>Guidance for owners and operators who want to improve their online presence and day-to-day operations.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Tourism &amp; local support</h3><p>Assistance with tourism-related services and local arrangements in Tanzania.</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Services vary by location and project, and not every service is available everywhere. Afrihouse does not guarantee bookings or revenue. Contact us to discuss what fits your property.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY -->
<section id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro"><h2>Why choose Afrihouse</h2></div>
    <ul class="why">
