      <li><h3>Website and operations together</h3><p>One partner who understands both how a property looks online and how it runs day to day.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Mobile-first</h3><p>Websites designed for phones first, because most guests browse and book on them.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Plain explanations, agreed scope and honest advice before any work begins.</p></li>
